Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:07:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] What-we-do cards: custom line icons

Four SVG line icons in the Fresh theme teal (#087F87) for Strategy,
Innovation, Modernization and Governance, replacing the placeholder
icons/strategy.svg path (which never existed, and wouldn't resolve:
asset() reads only the top level of src/assets/images/).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019m8fUeYBqr1dYU2BpC7DPn
